        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Retina merkezinin yanında oval şekilli yüksek oranda pigmente sarı nokta olan makula luteanın anormalliği</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A structural abnormality of the macula, a region that, in a clinical context, is typically used to describe the central part of the retina within the vascular arcades.</babelon:source_value>
