        <babelon:source_value>Lenticonus</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001144">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Periorbital dokular bölgesinde kist varlığı. Orbital kistler epitelyal veya bezsel veya orbitayı çevreleyen (lakrimal bezler, salgı bezleri, konjunktival, oral, nazal veya sinüs epiteli) dokulardan köken alır</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Orbital kist</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001144"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Periorbital dokular bölgesinde kist varlığı. Orbital kistler epitelyal veya bezsel veya orbitayı çevreleyen (lakrimal bezler, salgı bezleri, konjunktival, oral, nazal veya sinüs epiteli) dokulardan köken alır</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Presence of a cyst in the region of the periorbital tissues. Orbital cysts can be derived from epithelial or glandular tissue within or surrounding the orbit (lacrimal glands, salivary glands, conjunctival, oral, nasal, or sinus epithelium).</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001144"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Orbital kist</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Orbital cyst</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001147">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Retinal kan damarlarından sızmış retina yüzeyinde yüksek konsantrasyonda lipid, protein ve hücresel artık içeren, tipik olarak açık, yansıtan, beyaz veya krem renginde görünümde sıvı</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Retinal eksüdat</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001147"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Retinal kan damarlarından sızmış retina yüzeyinde yüksek konsantrasyonda lipid, protein ve hücresel artık içeren, tipik olarak açık, yansıtan, beyaz veya krem renginde görünümde sıvı</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Yellow-white intraretinal deposits in the retina typically associated with damaged inner blood-retina barrier and exudation of serous fluid and lipids from the retinal microvasculature.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001147"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Retinal eksüdat</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Retinal exudate</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001149">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Santral alanlarda klinik gidişatta perifere doğru yayılabilen, Bowman katmanında ince ve dallanan opasitelerin varlığı. Derin korneal stroma dahil olabilir fakat süreç Descemet membranına ulaşmaz. Tekrarlayan korneal erozyon oluşabilir. Histolojik inceleme korneanın kollajen fiberlerinde amiloid depolanmalarını ortaya çıkartır</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Kafes korneal distrofisi</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001149"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Santral alanlarda klinik gidişatta perifere doğru yayılabilen, Bowman katmanında ince ve dallanan opasitelerin varlığı. Derin korneal stroma dahil olabilir fakat süreç Descemet membranına ulaşmaz. Tekrarlayan korneal erozyon oluşabilir. Histolojik inceleme korneanın kollajen fiberlerinde amiloid depolanmalarını ortaya çıkartır</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>The presence of fine, branching linear opacities in Bowman&apos;s layer in the central area that may spread to the periphery in the clinical course. The deep corneal stroma may be involved but the process does not reach Descemet&apos;s membrane. Recurrent corneal erosion may occur. Histologic examination reveals amyloid deposits in the collagen fibers of the cornea.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001149"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Kafes korneal distrofisi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Lattice corneal dystrophy</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001151">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Yatay olarak hareket eden nesneleri takip etmedeki yetenekte bozulma ile karakterize oküler düz takip anormalliği</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Bozulmuş yatay düz takip</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001151"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Yatay olarak hareket eden nesneleri takip etmedeki yetenekte bozulma ile karakterize oküler düz takip anormalliği</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An abnormality of ocular smooth pursuit characterized by an impairment of the ability to track horizontally moving objects.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001151"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Bozulmuş yatay düz takip</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Impaired horizontal smooth pursuit</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001152">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Anormal şekilde yüksek sayıda salınımsal hareket ile sekteye uğrayan düz takip göz hareketleri takibi anormalliği</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Salınımsal düz takip</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001152"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Anormal şekilde yüksek sayıda salınımsal hareket ile sekteye uğrayan düz takip göz hareketleri takibi anormalliği</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An abnormality of tracking eye movements in which smooth pursuit is interrupted by an abnormally high number of saccadic movements.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001152"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Salınımsal düz takip</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Saccadic smooth pursuit interruptions</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001153">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Vajinal duplikasyon oluşturan vajinal septum varlığı. Çoğu vakada septum uzunlamasınadır</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Septalı vajina</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001153"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Vajinal duplikasyon oluşturan vajinal septum varlığı. Çoğu vakada septum uzunlamasınadır</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>The presence of a vaginal septum, thereby creating a vaginal duplication. The septum is longitudinal in the majority of cases.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001153"/>
