    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001328">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Öğrenme ile ilgili okuma veya yazma, koordinasyon, kendini kontrol etme veya dikkat gibi belirli becerilerin bozulması. Bozukluk global zeka eksikliği ile ilişkili değildir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Özel öğrenme bozukluğu</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001328"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Öğrenme ile ilgili okuma veya yazma, koordinasyon, kendini kontrol etme veya dikkat gibi belirli becerilerin bozulması. Bozukluk global zeka eksikliği ile ilişkili değildir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Impairment of certain skills such as reading or writing, coordination, self-control, or attention that interfere with the ability to learn. The impairment is not related to a global deficiency of intelligence.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001328"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Özel öğrenme bozukluğu</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Specific learning disability</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001331">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Septum pellusidumun yokluğu</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Septum pellusidum yokluğu</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001331"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Septum pellusidumun yokluğu</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Absence of the septum pellucidum (meaning translucent wall in Latin - SP), also known as the ventricle of Sylvius. The septum pellucidum is a thin, triangular double membrane separating the frontal horns of the right and left lateral ventricles of the brain. It extends between the anterior portion of the corpus callosum, and the body of the fornix and its width varies from 1.5 to 3.0 mm.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001331"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Septum pellusidum yokluğu</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Absent septum pellucidum</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001332">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Sabir anormal duruşa neden olan anormal şekilde artmış kas tonusu. Abartılmış dönme ve ekstremite ve gövde duruşuna yol açan yavaş, aralıklı bükülme hareketi vardır</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Distoni</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001332"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Sabir anormal duruşa neden olan anormal şekilde artmış kas tonusu. Abartılmış dönme ve ekstremite ve gövde duruşuna yol açan yavaş, aralıklı bükülme hareketi vardır</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An abnormally increased muscular tone that causes fixed abnormal postures. There is a slow, intermittent twisting motion that leads to exaggerated turning and posture of the extremities and trunk.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001332"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Distoni</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Dystonia</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001334">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Ventrikül ve subaraknoid boşluk arasındaki beyin omurilik sıvısı akışında görülür bir tıkanmanın olmadığı hidrosefali tipi</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Tıkanmayan hidrosefali</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001334"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Ventrikül ve subaraknoid boşluk arasındaki beyin omurilik sıvısı akışında görülür bir tıkanmanın olmadığı hidrosefali tipi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A form of hydrocephalus in which there is no visible obstruction to the flow of the cerebrospinal fluid between the ventricles and subarachnoid space.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
