        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Serebral korteksin girintilerinin doğumsal yokluğu ve Silviyan fissürün yetersiz şekillenmesi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A spectrum of malformations of cortical development caused by insufficient neuronal migration that subsumes the terms agyria, pachygyria and subcortical band heterotopia. See also neuropathological definitions for 2-, 3-, and 4-layered lissencephaly.</babelon:source_value>
