        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Heterotopia or neuronal heterotopia are macroscopic clusters of misplaced neurons (gray matter), most often situated along the ventricular walls or within the subcortical white matter.</babelon:source_value>
