        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">CD4-negatif, CD8-negatif (çift negatif veya DN), alfa-beta düzenleyici T hücreleri (tregs) toplam T hücrelerinin sayısına göre anormal derecede artmış bir oran</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormal increase of double negative (DN) CD3+CD4-CD8- T cells, measured as percentage of total CD3+ T cells in the blood, compared to a reference range for a given sex and age-group. These are usually measured within the TCR alpha/beta positive population.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
