        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Parapharngeal alanın retrostiloid bölmesinde gelişen, vagus sinirinde bulunan sinir başından elde edilen bir paragangliyon dokusu kümesinden kaynaklanan bir tümör</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A tumor that develops in the retrostyloid compartment of the parapharyngeal space, arising from an island of paraganglion tissue derived from the neural crest that is located on the vagus nerve.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
