        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Kemikli ya da ligamentöz bir anormalliğin sonucu olarak ilk servikal (atlas) ve ikinci servikal (axis) vertebra arasındaki birleşimdeki anormal artmış hareket</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormally increased movement at the junction between the first cervical (atlas) and the second cervical (axis) vertebrae as a result of either a bony or ligamentous anomaly.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
