        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Lizozomal-koful yolak protein kompleksleri ve organelleri gibi makromoleküllerin kontrollü hücre sindiriminde bir role sahiptir. Bu özellik, kas dokusundaki anormal artmış sayıda ki otofajik koful varlığına karşılık gelir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>The lysosomal-vacuolar pathway has a role in the controlled intracellular digestion of macromolecules such as protein complexes and organelles. This feature refers to the presence of an abnormally increased number of autophagic vacuoles in muscle tissue.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
