        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Folata yanıtsız megaloblastik anemi</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0004826"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Folatın uygulanmasından sonra gelişmeyen bir megaloblastik anemi türü. B12 vitamini, folatın geri dönüşümünü teşvik ederek etki gösterdiğinden, B12 vitamininin uygulanması da bu tür anemiyi düzeltmez</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A type of megaloblastic anemia that does not improve upon administration of folate. Since vitamin B12 acts by promoting recycling of folate, administration of vitamin B12 also does not improve this type of anemia.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0004826"/>
