        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A separation of the layers within the wall of the ascending aorta. Tears in the intimal layer result in the propagation of dissection (proximally or distally) secondary to blood entering the intima-media space.</babelon:source_value>
