        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A type of craniofacial dysostosis associated with abnormalities of the external ears, mirognathia, macrostomia, coloboma of the lower eyelid, and cleft palate. This is a bundled term that is left in the HPO now for convenience with legacy annotations but should not be used for new annotations.</babelon:source_value>
