        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Inflammation of the coronary arteries involving a granulomatous response, i.e., a non-specific inflammatory response involving granulomas, defined as a compact organized collection of mature mononuclear phagocytes including epithelioid and giant cells.</babelon:source_value>
