        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Premature ventricular contractions (PVC) or ventricular extrasystoles are premature contractions of the heart that arise in response to an impulse in the ventricles rather than the normal impulse from the sinoatrial (SA) node.</babelon:source_value>
