        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Paratiroid bezlerinin birincil anormalliğinin sebep olduğu bir tür hiperparatiroidizm (örneğin, Adenom, karsinom, hiperplazi). Primer hiperparatiroidizm hiperkalsemi ile alakalıdır</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A type of hyperparathyroidism caused by a primary abnormality of the parathyroid glands (e.g., adenoma, carcinoma, hyperplasia). Primary hyperparathyroidism is associated with hyercalcemia.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
