        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Increase in thickness of the wall of the urinary bladder. This finding may be seen in conditions such as bladder outlet obstruction and may be accompanied by increased trabeculation of the bladder wall musculature.</babelon:source_value>
