    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009216"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">&quot;Elin yüzük parmağının orta falanksının epifizinin koni biçimli görünüşü, &quot;&quot;bilye büyüklüğünde şişlik&quot;&quot; görünümü üretir. Bu epifiz, falanksın proksimal ucunda bulunur ve normalde neredeyse düzdür. İlgili varlık &apos;melek şekilli&apos; epifiz, falanks distal ucunda bir pseudoepiphysis ile birlikte belirgin bir koni şekilli epifizi ifade eder&quot;</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A cone-shaped appearance of the epiphysis of the middle phalanx of the ring finger of the hand, producing a &apos;ball-in-a-socket&apos; appearance. This epiphysis is located at the proximal end of the phalanx and is normally nearly flat. The related entity &apos;angel-shaped&apos; epiphysis refers to a pronounced cone-shaped epiphysis in combination with a pseudoepiphysis at the distal end of the phalanx.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009216"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">4. el parmağının orta falanksının koni şekilli epifizi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Cone-shaped epiphysis of the middle phalanx of the 4th finger</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
