        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Yaşa bağlı normlara bağlı olarak 4. parmağın orta falanksının distal ucunda lokalize olmuş epifizin anormal büyük boyutu</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormally large size of the epiphysis located at the proximal end of the distal phalanx of the 4th finger with respect to age-dependent norms.</babelon:source_value>
