    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009881">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Elin distal falankslarının aplazisi</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009881"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Elin distal falankslarının aplazisi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Aplasia of distal finger phalanx</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009882">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Parmak ucundan en distal interfalangeyal çizgiye veya distal interfalangiyal eklem fleksiyon noktasına olan kısa mesafe. Bu, parmağın bir veya daha fazla distal falanksının hipoplazisidir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Parmağın kısa distal falanksı</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009882"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Parmak ucundan en distal interfalangeyal çizgiye veya distal interfalangiyal eklem fleksiyon noktasına olan kısa mesafe. Bu, parmağın bir veya daha fazla distal falanksının hipoplazisidir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Short distance from the end of the finger to the most distal interphalangeal crease or the distal interphalangeal joint flexion point. That is, hypoplasia of one or more of the distal phalanx of finger.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009882"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Parmağın kısa distal falanksı</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Short distal phalanx of finger</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009883">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Bu terim, elin distal falankslarından biri veya birkaçının, geniş bir yol açan şiddetinin yada falankslarının bifid görünümüne yada tamamen - kısmen çoğaltılmasına bağlı olarak kullanılır</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Elin distal falanksının duplikasyonu</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009883"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Bu terim, elin distal falankslarından biri veya birkaçının, geniş bir yol açan şiddetinin yada falankslarının bifid görünümüne yada tamamen - kısmen çoğaltılmasına bağlı olarak kullanılır</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>This term applies if one or more of the distal phalanges of the hand are either partially duplicated, depending on severity leading to a broad or bifid appearance of the phalanges, or completely duplicated.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009883"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Elin distal falanksının duplikasyonu</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Duplication of the distal phalanx of hand</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009884">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Parmak distal falanks çapında distal uca doğru bir azalma</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Parmağın giderek incelen distal falanksları</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009884"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Parmak distal falanks çapında distal uca doğru bir azalma</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A reduction in diameter of the distal phalanx of finger towards the distal end.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009884"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Parmağın giderek incelen distal falanksları</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Tapered distal phalanges of finger</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009886">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Trikoreksis nodosa, kırılmanın kolayca oluştuğu saç gövdesinde düğümlerin oluşumudur. Bu saç telinin kolayca kopmasına neden olan kalın veya zayıf noktalar (düğümler) ile karakterize edilen bir fokal kusurudur. Sonuç, kusurlu, anormal kırılgan saçtır</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Trikoreksis nodoza</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009886"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Trikoreksis nodosa, kırılmanın kolayca oluştuğu saç gövdesinde düğümlerin oluşumudur. Bu saç telinin kolayca kopmasına neden olan kalın veya zayıf noktalar (düğümler) ile karakterize edilen bir fokal kusurudur. Sonuç, kusurlu, anormal kırılgan saçtır</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Trichorrhexis nodosa is the formation of nodes along the hair shaft through which breakage readily occurs. It is thus a focal defect in the hair fiber that is characterized by thickening or weak points (nodes) that cause the hair to break off easily. The result is defective, abnormally fragile hair.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009886"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Trikoreksis nodoza</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Trichorrhexis nodosa</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
