        <babelon:source_value>The presence of a lung fibroma, a benign neoplasm that can present as a mass causing airway obstruction, cough, and hemoptysis, or present without symptoms as a solitary pulmonary nodule.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
