        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Periyodik lateralize epileptiform boşalımlar (PLED) periyodik, lateralize ve epileptiformdur. PLED&apos;ler boşalımlar arasında göreceli sabit bir aralık (0.5 - 3 saniye) gösterirler</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Periodic lateralized epileptiform discharges (PLEDs)are periodic, lateralized, and epileptiform. PLEDs show a relatively constant interval between discharges (0.5 to 3 seconds).</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
