        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Talon cusp is an accessory cusp located near the cingulum (the portion of the lingual or palatal aspect of the tooth that forms a convex protuberance at the cervical third of the anatomic crown).</babelon:source_value>
