    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011590">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">İnen aortayı oluşturmak için iki embriyonik aort kemerinin trakea veya özofagusu çevreleyen ve daha sonra birleştiği vasküler bir halka oluşturduğu aort kemerinin konjenital anomalisi. Çifte aortik kemer özofagusun (yeme sırasında disfaji, siyanoz) veya trakeanın (stridor) sıkışması nedeniyle semptomlara neden olabilir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Çift aortik ark</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011590"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">İnen aortayı oluşturmak için iki embriyonik aort kemerinin trakea veya özofagusu çevreleyen ve daha sonra birleştiği vasküler bir halka oluşturduğu aort kemerinin konjenital anomalisi. Çifte aortik kemer özofagusun (yeme sırasında disfaji, siyanoz) veya trakeanın (stridor) sıkışması nedeniyle semptomlara neden olabilir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A conenital abnormality of the aortic arch in which the two embryonic aortc arches form a vascular ring that surrounds the trachea or esophagus and then join to form the descending aorta. Double aortic arch can cause symptoms because of compression of the esophagus (dysphagia, cyanosis while eating) or trachea (stridor).</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011590"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Çift aortik ark</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Double aortic arch</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011591">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Servikal kökenli sağ subklaviyan arteri ile sol aortik ark</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011591"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Servikal kökenli sağ subklaviyan arteri ile sol aortik ark</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Left aortic arch with cervical origin of the right subclavian artery</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011592">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Subklaviyen arter duktus arteriyozustan köken alır. Duktus arteriyozus patent olduğunda kan desteği duktustan gelir, değilse pulmoner arterden. Kapandıktan sonra, kan akımı Willis çemberinden retrograd olarak vertebral arterdendir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">İzole subklaviyen arterli sol aortik ark</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011592"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Subklaviyen arter duktus arteriyozustan köken alır. Duktus arteriyozus patent olduğunda kan desteği duktustan gelir, değilse pulmoner arterden. Kapandıktan sonra, kan akımı Willis çemberinden retrograd olarak vertebral arterdendir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>The subclavian artery arises from ductus arteriosus. While the ductus arteriosus is patent its blood supply comes from the ductus, hence from the pulmonary artery. After it closes, the blood supply is retrogradely from the vertebral artery via the circle of Willis.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011592"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">İzole subklaviyen arterli sol aortik ark</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Left aortic arch with isolated subclavian artery</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011593">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Halkayı tamamlayan bir patent duktus arteriyozus veya duktal ligament</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Kommerell&apos;in retroözofagiyal divertikülümü ile olan sol aortik ark</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011593"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Halkayı tamamlayan bir patent duktus arteriyozus veya duktal ligament</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A patent ductus arteriosus or ductal ligament completes the ring.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011593"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Kommerell&apos;in retroözofagiyal divertikülümü ile olan sol aortik ark</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Left aortic arch with retroesophageal diverticulum of Kommerell</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011594">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Aortik ark sağ ana bronşu çaprazlar. Sol karotid arter ilk, sağ karotid arter ikinci ve sağ subklaviyen arter üçüncü daldır</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Kommerell&apos;in retroözofagiyal divertikülümü ile olan sağ aortik ark</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011594"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Aortik ark sağ ana bronşu çaprazlar. Sol karotid arter ilk, sağ karotid arter ikinci ve sağ subklaviyen arter üçüncü daldır</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Aortic arch crosses the right mainstem bronchus. The left carotid artery is the first branch, right carotid artery the second branch and right subclavian artery as the third branch.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011594"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Kommerell&apos;in retroözofagiyal divertikülümü ile olan sağ aortik ark</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Right aortic arch with retroesophageal diverticulum of Kommerell</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011595">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Aortik kemer, sol ana stende bronşundan geçer. İlk dal sağ karotid arter, ikinci dal sol karotid arter, üçüncü dal subklavian arter, dördüncü dal sağ aortik arkın posteromedial yönünden ortaya çıkan ve özofagustan sonra devam eden subklavian arterdir vücudun sağ tarafına konumlanmıştır</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Retroözofagiyal sağ subklaviyen arterli sol aortik ark</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011595"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Aortik kemer, sol ana stende bronşundan geçer. İlk dal sağ karotid arter, ikinci dal sol karotid arter, üçüncü dal subklavian arter, dördüncü dal sağ aortik arkın posteromedial yönünden ortaya çıkan ve özofagustan sonra devam eden subklavian arterdir vücudun sağ tarafına konumlanmıştır</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Aortic arch crosses the left mainstem bronchus. The first branch is the right carotid artery, the second branch is the left carotid artery, the third branch is the subclavian artery, the fourth branch is the right subclavian artery arising from the posteromedial aspect of the distal aortic arch and continuing posterior to the esophagus to the right hand side of the body.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011595"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Retroözofagiyal sağ subklaviyen arterli sol aortik ark</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Left aortic arch with retroesophageal right subclavian artery</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011596">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Halka duktal ligament tarafından tamamlanabilir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Sağ inen aorta ve sağ duktus arteriozus ile sol aortik ark</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011596"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Halka duktal ligament tarafından tamamlanabilir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>The ring may be completed by the ductal ligament.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011596"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Sağ inen aorta ve sağ duktus arteriozus ile sol aortik ark</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Left aortic arch with right descending aorta and right ductus arteriosus</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011597">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Sol inen aorta ve sol duktus arteriozus ile sağ aortik ark</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011597"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Sol inen aorta ve sol duktus arteriozus ile sağ aortik ark</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Right aortic arch with left descending aorta and left ductus arteriosus</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011598">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Retroözofageyal sol subklaviyen arterli sağ aortik ark</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011598"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Retroözofageyal sol subklaviyen arterli sağ aortik ark</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Right aortic arch with retroesophageal left subclavian artery</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011599">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Mezokardiya kalbin orta hatta pozisyonunda olduğu ve kalbin uzun aksının orta-sagittal düzlemde yer aldığı anormal bir kalp lokasyonudur</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Mezokardiya</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011599"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Mezokardiya kalbin orta hatta pozisyonunda olduğu ve kalbin uzun aksının orta-sagittal düzlemde yer aldığı anormal bir kalp lokasyonudur</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Mesocardia is an abnormal location of the heart in which the heart is in a midline position and the longitudinal axis of the heart lies in the mid-sagittal plane.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011599"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Mezokardiya</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Mesocardia</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011600">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Tabandan apekse doğru kalbin anormal düzlem yönü. Sol taraflı olması normaldir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Ventriküler apeksin anormal yönü</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011600"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Tabandan apekse doğru kalbin anormal düzlem yönü. Sol taraflı olması normaldir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormal plane of direction of the heart from the base to the apex. Left sided is normal.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011600"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Ventriküler apeksin anormal yönü</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormal direction of ventricular apex</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011601">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Tabandan apekse doğru kalbin sağa doğru anormal düzlem yönü. Sol taraflı olması normaldir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Ventriküler apeksin sağa doğru yönü</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011601"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Tabandan apekse doğru kalbin sağa doğru anormal düzlem yönü. Sol taraflı olması normaldir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormal plane of direction of the heart from the base to the apex towards the right. Left sided is normal.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011601"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Ventriküler apeksin sağa doğru yönü</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Rightward direction of ventricular apex</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011602">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Tabandan apekse doğru kalbin orta hatta anormal düzlem yönü. Sol taraflı olması normaldir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Ventriküler apeksin orta hat yönü</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011602"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Tabandan apekse doğru kalbin orta hatta anormal düzlem yönü. Sol taraflı olması normaldir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormal plane of direction of the heart from the base to the apex in the midline. Left sided is normal.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011602"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Ventriküler apeksin orta hat yönü</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Midline direction of ventricular apex</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011603">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Aortun ve pulmoner arterlerin morfogenez defekti veya defektleri</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Büyük arterlerin konjenital malformasyonu</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011603"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Aortun ve pulmoner arterlerin morfogenez defekti veya defektleri</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Defect or defects of the morphogenesis of the aorta and pulmonary arteries.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011603"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Büyük arterlerin konjenital malformasyonu</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Congenital malformation of the great arteries</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011604">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Aort ve ana pulmoner arter arasında aortopulmoner şant ile sonuçlanan anormal bağlantılı bir konjenital anomali</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Aortopulmoner pencere</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0011604"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Aort ve ana pulmoner arter arasında aortopulmoner şant ile sonuçlanan anormal bağlantılı bir konjenital anomali</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A congenital anomaly with an abnormal connection between the aorta and the main pulmonary artery resulting in an aortopulmonary shunt.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
