        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Truncus arteriosus (single great artery leaving the base of the heart, giving rise to the coronary, pulmonary, and systemic arteries) whereby the aortic arch is hypoplastic or interrupted, and a large patent ductus arteriosus is present.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
