        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Systemic desaturation of a liveborn baby resulting from persistent pulmonary hypertension with a patent ductus arteriosus and patent foramen ovale, such that the circulation in postnatal life follows the fetal course.</babelon:source_value>
