        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A form of adrenal insufficiency related to a lack of ACTH, which leads to a decrease in the production of cortisol by the adrenal glands. Aldosterone production is not usually affected.</babelon:source_value>
