        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Projection of the tip of the dens more than 5 mm above a line joining the hard palate to the posterior lip of the foramen magnum (Chamberlain&apos;s line) or the tip of the dens is greater than 7 mm above McGregor&apos;s line (the back of the hard palate to the lowest point of the occipital squama).</babelon:source_value>
