        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Serumda anormal bir aldolaz konsantrasyonu. Aldolaz fruktoz 1,6-bifosfatı trioz fosfata, dihidroksiaseton fosfata ve gliseraldehit 3-fosfata dönüştürmekle sorumlu bir enzimdir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An abnormal concentration of aldolase in the serum. Aldolase is an enzyme responsible for converting fructose 1,6-bisphosphate into the triose phosphates dihydroxyacetone phosphate and glyceraldehyde 3-phosphate.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
