        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Mandibüler hareket (örn, çiğneme) esnasında temporomandibüler eklemden ses gelmesi. Temporomandibüler eklem krepitusu sıklıkla tıklama, patlama, tırmalama sesi olarak tarif edilir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Noises from the temporomandibular joint during mandibular movement (e.g., chewing). Temporomandibular joint crepitus is often described as a clicking, popping, grating sound.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
