    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012671">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Davranış ve konuşma çıkışı yoksulluğu, inisiyatif eksikliği, duygusal yanıt kaybı, psikomotor yavaşlama ve uzamış konuşma gecikmesi</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Abuli</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012671"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Davranış ve konuşma çıkışı yoksulluğu, inisiyatif eksikliği, duygusal yanıt kaybı, psikomotor yavaşlama ve uzamış konuşma gecikmesi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abulia is characterized by difficulty in initiating and sustaining spontaneous movements; the person often appears frozen but will move hesitantly on request. There are frequently substantial reductions in emotional responsiveness, spontaneous speech, and social interaction. The individual appears to be content to remain still and inactive with minimal movement, but moves or reacts hesitantly in response to interactions.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012671"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Abuli</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abulia</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012672">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Akinetik mutizm, korunmuş görsel takip varlığında esas olarak rasgele davranışın ve konuşmanın tam yokluğu ile karakterizedir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Akinetik mutizm</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012672"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Akinetik mutizm, korunmuş görsel takip varlığında esas olarak rasgele davranışın ve konuşmanın tam yokluğu ile karakterizedir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>The combined absence of spontaneous movement (akinesia) and speech (mutism). There may be eye movements consistent with visual tracking and the person may remember the events occurring at the time of the experience of stupor.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012672"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Akinetik mutizm</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Akinetic mutism</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0012673">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Üst vajina gelişmesinin başarısızlığı</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Üst vajinanın aplazisi</rdfs:label>
