        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A darker than expected T2 signal on magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) of the thalamus. This term refers to a diffuse hypointensity affecting the entire thalamus.</babelon:source_value>
