        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">İnspirasyonda trakeal çekilme</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025008"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Trakeobronşiyal ağaçta aşağı doğru traksiyona bağlı inspirasyon esnasında trakeanın aşağı hareketi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Downward movement of the trachea during inspiration due to downward traction on the tracheobronchial tree.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025008"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">İnspirasyonda trakeal çekilme</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Tracheal tug on inspiration</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025009">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Dışa doğru eğilim yerine, yüzün yüzeyine kabaca paralel olan normal açıdan sapan üst kesiciler</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">İleri eğilen üst kesiciler</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025009"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Dışa doğru eğilim yerine, yüzün yüzeyine kabaca paralel olan normal açıdan sapan üst kesiciler</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>The upper incisors deviate from the normal angle of being roughly parallel to the surface of the face and instead slant outwards.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025009"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">İleri eğilen üst kesiciler</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Forward slanting upper incisors</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025010">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Önceden var olan foveal dokunun kısmi veya tam kaybı</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Foveal atrofi</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025010"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Önceden var olan foveal dokunun kısmi veya tam kaybı</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A nonspecific term denoting wasting, especially as a result of degeneration, of the retinal pigment epithelium (RPE) and neurosensory retinal cells in the fovea.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025010"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Foveal atrofi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Foveal atrophy</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025011">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Burnun kemiksi girişini oluşturan kafatasındaki armut şekilli açıklık olan ön burun açıklığının (piriform veya piriform apertür) daralması</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Piriform apartür stenozu</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025011"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Burnun kemiksi girişini oluşturan kafatasındaki armut şekilli açıklık olan ön burun açıklığının (piriform veya piriform apertür) daralması</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Narrowing of the anterior nasal aperture (piriform or pyriform aperture), which is a pear-shaped opening in the skull that forms the bony inlet of the nose.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025011"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Piriform apartür stenozu</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Pyriform aperture stenosis</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025012">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Bazal gangliyonlarda, özellikle korpus striatumunu etkileyen, perivasküler boşlukların genişlemesi. Durum kribrosum genellikle simetriktir, perivasküler boşluklar difüzyon kısıtlaması olmadan BOS sinyali gösterir. Kribriform kelimesi, sizgece benzer çoklu perforasyon demektir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Status kribrozum</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025012"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Bazal gangliyonlarda, özellikle korpus striatumunu etkileyen, perivasküler boşlukların genişlemesi. Durum kribrosum genellikle simetriktir, perivasküler boşluklar difüzyon kısıtlaması olmadan BOS sinyali gösterir. Kribriform kelimesi, sizgece benzer çoklu perforasyon demektir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Diffusely widened perivascular spaces in the basal ganglia, affecting especially the corpus striatum. Status cribrosum is usually symmetrical, with the perivascular spaces showing CSF signal and without diffusion restriction. The word cribriform means sievelike, with multiple perforations.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025012"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Status kribrozum</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Status cribrosum</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025013">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Bütün ekstremitelerin abartılı ekstansör postürü ile ortaya çıkan bir rijidite tipi</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Deserebre katılığı</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025013"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Bütün ekstremitelerin abartılı ekstansör postürü ile ortaya çıkan bir rijidite tipi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A type of rigidity that is manifested by an exaggerated extensor posture of all extremities.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025013"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Deserebre katılığı</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Decerebrate rigidity</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025014">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Deri altında bacakların ve kolların kemik çıkıntıları üzerinde serbestçe hareket edebilen, röntgende translüsen çekirdekli dış kalsifiye katmana sahip olan küçük, sert, kist benzeri nodüller</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Subkutanöz sferoidler</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025014"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Deri altında bacakların ve kolların kemik çıkıntıları üzerinde serbestçe hareket edebilen, röntgende translüsen çekirdekli dış kalsifiye katmana sahip olan küçük, sert, kist benzeri nodüller</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Small, hard cyst-like nodules, freely moveable in the subcutis over the bony prominences of the legs and arms, which have an outer calcified layer with a translucent core on x-ray.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025014"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Subkutanöz sferoidler</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Subcutaneous spheroids</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025015">
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Anormal damar morfolojisi</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
