    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025066"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Azalmış ortalama eritrosit hacmi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Decreased mean corpuscular volume</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025068">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">(i) defektif göz hareketi (ii) asimetrik uyumsal efor ile ilişkili bakışın yönü veya hangi gözün sabitlendiğine göre sapma açısının farklılaştığı strabismus</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">İnkomitan strabismus</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025068"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">(i) defektif göz hareketi (ii) asimetrik uyumsal efor ile ilişkili bakışın yönü veya hangi gözün sabitlendiğine göre sapma açısının farklılaştığı strabismus</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Strabismus in which the angle of deviation differs depending upon the direction of gaze or according to which eye is fixing, associated with: (i) defective movement of the eye, (ii) asymmetrical accommodative effort.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025068"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">İnkomitan strabismus</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Incomitant strabismus</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025069">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Şaşıran gözün sapma açısının bütün bakış yönlerinde ve hangi gözün sabitlediğine bakılmaksızın diğer göze göre aynı kaldığı strabismus</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Konkomitan strabismus</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025069"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Şaşıran gözün sapma açısının bütün bakış yönlerinde ve hangi gözün sabitlediğine bakılmaksızın diğer göze göre aynı kaldığı strabismus</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Strabismus in which the angle of deviation of the squiting eye remains the same in relation to the other eye, in all directions of gaze, and whichever eye is fixing.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025069"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Konkomitan strabismus</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Concomitant strabismus</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025070">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Elektrokardiyogramda (EKG) U dalgası anomalisi. U dalgası T dalgasını hemen takiben olan, genellikle T dalgası ile aynı yönde küçük (0.5 mm) bir sapmadır. En iyi V2 ve V3 kablolarında görülebilir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Anormal U dalgası</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025070"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Elektrokardiyogramda (EKG) U dalgası anomalisi. U dalgası T dalgasını hemen takiben olan, genellikle T dalgası ile aynı yönde küçük (0.5 mm) bir sapmadır. En iyi V2 ve V3 kablolarında görülebilir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An anomaly of the U wave of the electrocardiogram (EKG). The U wave is a small (0.5 mm) deflection immediately following the T wave, usually in the same direction as the T wave. It is best seen in leads V2 and V3.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025070"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Anormal U dalgası</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormal U wave</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025071">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">U dalgasının yönü T dalgasının üste baktığı kablolarda T dalgasının tersinedir (örn bazal çizginin aşağısında)</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">U dalgası inversiyonu</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025071"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">U dalgasının yönü T dalgasının üste baktığı kablolarda T dalgasının tersinedir (örn bazal çizginin aşağısında)</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Direction of the U wave opposite to the T wave (i.e., below baseline) in leads with upright T waves.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025071"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">U dalgası inversiyonu</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>U wave inversion</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025072">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Genliğin T dalga yüksekliğinden 1-2 mm&apos;den veya yüzde 25&apos;ten daha fazla olması olarak tanımlanan U dalgasının artmış genliği</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Belirgin U dalgası</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025072"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Genliğin T dalga yüksekliğinden 1-2 mm&apos;den veya yüzde 25&apos;ten daha fazla olması olarak tanımlanan U dalgasının artmış genliği</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Increased amplitude of the U wave, defined as an amplitude greater than 1-2mm or 25 percent of the height of the T wave.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025072"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Belirgin U dalgası</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Prominent U wave</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025073">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Egzersiz stres testi ile indüklenen U dalga inversiyonu</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Egzersize bağlı U dalgası inversiyonu</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025073"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Egzersiz stres testi ile indüklenen U dalga inversiyonu</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>U wave inversion that is induced by exercise stress testing.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025073"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Egzersize bağlı U dalgası inversiyonu</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Exercise-induced U wave inversion</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025074">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Elektrokardiyogramda birbirini hızla takip ederek oluşan Q, R ve S dalgaları tarafından oluşturulmuş kompleksin anomalisi</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Anormal QRS kompleksi</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025074"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Elektrokardiyogramda birbirini hızla takip ederek oluşan Q, R ve S dalgaları tarafından oluşturulmuş kompleksin anomalisi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An anomaly of the complex formed by the Q, R, and S waves, which occur in rapid succession on the electrocardiogram.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025074"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Anormal QRS kompleksi</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormal QRS complex</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025075">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">QRS kompleksinin voltajında (yükseklik) yükselme. Kullanımda birden çok kriter vardır fakat en sık Sokolov-Lyon kriteridir (V1&apos;deki S dalga derinliği + V5-V6&apos;daki en yüksek R dalgası yüksekliği 35 mm&apos;den büyük)</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Artmış QRS voltajı</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025075"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">QRS kompleksinin voltajında (yükseklik) yükselme. Kullanımda birden çok kriter vardır fakat en sık Sokolov-Lyon kriteridir (V1&apos;deki S dalga derinliği + V5-V6&apos;daki en yüksek R dalgası yüksekliği 35 mm&apos;den büyük)</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Elevation of the voltage (height) of the QRS complex. There are several criteria in use, but the most common is the Sokolov-Lyon criterion (S wave depth in V1 + tallest R wave height in V5-V6 greater than 35 mm).</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025075"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Artmış QRS voltajı</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Increased QRS voltage</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025076">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Elektrokardiyogramın (EKG) anormal QRS kompleksi genliği</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Anormal QRS voltajı</rdfs:label>
