        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025082"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Derinin elastik liflerinin herhangi yapısal bir anomalisi. Elastik lifler fibrillinden zengin mikrofibriller örtüsü tarafından çevrelenmiş elastin bir çekirdekten oluşan hücre dışı matriksin esansiyel makromolekülleridir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Any structural anomaly of the elastic fibers of the skin. Elastic fibers are the essential extracellular matrix macromolecules comprising an elastin core surrounded by a mantle of fibrillin-rich microfibrils.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
