    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025418">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Böbreğin dış kısmında doku ölümü</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Renal kortikal nekroz</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025418"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Böbreğin dış kısmında doku ölümü</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Patchy or diffuse ischemic destruction of all the elements of renal cortex resulting from significantly diminished renal arterial perfusion. Coagulative necrosis may be present, involving all tubular segments and glomeruli. Nuclei may be pale and pyknotic, or may no longer be apparent. Thrombi may be present in vessels at the edge of the infarct.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025418"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Renal kortikal nekroz</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Renal cortical necrosis</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025419">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Bir akciğer içinde hava dolu kistik bir boşluk</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Pulmoner pnömatosel</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Bir akciğer içinde hava dolu kistik bir boşluk</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A pneumatocele is a thin walled, gas-filled space in the lung. It is most frequently caused by acute pneumonia, trauma, or aspiration of hydrocarbon fluid and is usually transient. The mechanism is believed to be a combination of parenchymal necrosis and check-valve airway obstruction. A pneumatocele appears as an approximately round, thin-walled airspace in the lung.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025419"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Pulmoner pnömatosel</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Pulmonary pneumatocele</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025420">
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="tr">Alveolar kılcal damarlar, arterioller ve venüller de dahil olmak üzere pulmoner mikrosirkülasyondan kaynaklanan pulmoner kanama tipi. Hemoptisis, anemi, diffüz akciğer infiltrasyonu ve akut solunum yetmezliği ile kendini gösterir. Teşhis, patolojik biyopside alveolar alanda kırmızı kan hücreleri, fibrin veya hemosiderin yüklü makrofaj birikiminin gözlenmesi ile doğrulanır. Hemoglobin degradasyonunun bir ürünü olan hemosiderin, ve kanamadan en az 48-72 saat sonra ortaya çıkar ve diffüz alveolar kanamayı cerrahi travmadan ayırmada yardımcı olur. Hafif dokular arası kalınlaşma, organize pnömoni veya diffüz alveol hasarı da görülebilir</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="tr">Yaygın alveolar hemoraji</rdfs:label>
    </rdf:Description>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025420"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Alveolar kılcal damarlar, arterioller ve venüller de dahil olmak üzere pulmoner mikrosirkülasyondan kaynaklanan pulmoner kanama tipi. Hemoptisis, anemi, diffüz akciğer infiltrasyonu ve akut solunum yetmezliği ile kendini gösterir. Teşhis, patolojik biyopside alveolar alanda kırmızı kan hücreleri, fibrin veya hemosiderin yüklü makrofaj birikiminin gözlenmesi ile doğrulanır. Hemoglobin degradasyonunun bir ürünü olan hemosiderin, ve kanamadan en az 48-72 saat sonra ortaya çıkar ve diffüz alveolar kanamayı cerrahi travmadan ayırmada yardımcı olur. Hafif dokular arası kalınlaşma, organize pnömoni veya diffüz alveol hasarı da görülebilir</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A type of of pulmonary hemorrhage that originates from the pulmonary microcirculation, including the alveolar capillaries, arterioles, and venules. It presents with hemoptysis, anemia, diffuse lung infiltration, and acute respiratory failure. The diagnosis is confirmed by the observation of the accumulation of red blood cells, fibrin, or hemosiderin-laden macrophage in the alveolar space on pathologic biopsy. Hemosiderin, a product of hemoglobin degradation, appears at least 48-72 hours after bleeding and is helpful in distinguishing diffuse alveolar hemorrhage from surgical trauma. Mild interstitial thickening, organizing pneumonia, or diffuse alveolar damage can also be seen.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0025420"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Yaygın alveolar hemoraji</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Diffuse alveolar hemorrhage</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
