        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A macule (flat, distinct, discolored area of skin less than 1 cm wide that does not involve any change in the thickness or texture of the skin) with a red or reddish color often associated with inflammation or irritation.</babelon:source_value>
