        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Kas dokusunda alfa sarkoglikan eksikliği. İmmünohistokimya kas biyopsisinde olmayan alfa sarkoglikanı tespit eder</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Lack of alpha sarcoglycan in muscle. Immunohistochemistry reveals absent alpha sarcoglycan protein in the muscle biopsy.</babelon:source_value>
