        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">İmmunohistokimya, kas biyopsisinde indirgenmiş perlecan proteinini ortaya çıkarmaktadır. Perlecan, heparan sülfat proteoglikan 2 (HSPG2) olarak da bilinen bazal zara özgül heparan sülfat proteoglikan çekirdek proteini (HSPG)</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Immunohistochemistry reveals reduced perlecan protein in the muscle biopsy. Perlecan is a basement membrane-specific heparan sulfate proteoglycan core protein (HSPG) also known as heparan sulfate proteoglycan 2 (HSPG2).</babelon:source_value>
