        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0030130"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">Von Willibrand faktörünün (vWF) kolajen bağlama yeteneğinin azalması. Plazma von WIllebrand Factor&apos;un kollajen bağlama yeteneğinin azalması veya eksikliği ile kendini gösteren, kolajene verilen anormal tepki. Genellikle ELISA&apos;ya dayalı bir analiz kullanılır; test, von Willebrand Factor&apos;un yüksek molekül ağırlıklı multimerlerin kaybına karşı hassastır</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Reduced ability of von Willebrand factor (vWF) to bind collagen. Abnormal response to collagen as manifested by reduced or lacking ability of plasma von WIllebrand Factor to bind collagen. An ELISA-based assay is typically used; the test is sensitive to loss of von Willebrand Factor high molecular weight multimers.</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>CANDIDATE</babelon:translation_status>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
