        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A deviation from normal in the expression of valosin-containing protein in muscle tissue. Valosin-containing protein is an ubiquitously expressed multifunctional 100-kD protein that is a member of the AAA+ (ATPase associated with various activities) protein family.</babelon:source_value>
