        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="tr">İnsülin tolerans testinin (İTT) hem adrenokortikotropik hormonu (ACTH) hem de büyüme hormonunu (BH) uyardığı gibi glukagon stimülasyon testine anomalili bir yanıt</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>An anomalous response to the glucagon stimulation test, which like the insulin tolerance test (ITT) stimulates the release of both adrenocorticotropic hormone (ACTH) and growth hormone (GH).</babelon:source_value>
        <babelon:translation_language>tr</babelon:translation_language>
        <babelon:translation_status>OFFICIAL</babelon:translation_status>
