        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Opacity refers to any area that preferentially attenuates the x-ray beam and therefore appears more opaque than the surrounding area. It is a nonspecific term that does not indicate the size or pathologic nature of the abnormality.</babelon:source_value>
