        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A subtype of fundus hemorrhage occurring within the neurosensory retina. Intraretinal hemorrhages may be &apos;dot&apos; or&apos; blot&apos; shaped, flame shaped or confluent depending upon their depth within the retina.</babelon:source_value>
