        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>A congenital abnormality of the cerebral hemisphere characterized by lack of gyrations (convolutions) of the cerebral cortex. Agyria is defined as cortical regions lacking gyration with sulci great than 3 cm apart and cerebral cortex thicker than 5 mm.</babelon:source_value>
