        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Heterophorias are latent deviations that are controlled by fusion. In certain circumstances (specific visual tasks, fatigue, illness, etc.), fusion can no longer be maintained and decompensation occurs.</babelon:source_value>
