        <babelon:source_language>en</babelon:source_language>
        <babelon:source_value>Abnormal increase or decrease of total natural killer (NK) cells, commonly characterized as CD3-CD19- and CD16+ or CD56+ lymphocytes, in the blood, per microlitre, or altered NK cell phenotype, compared to a reference range for a given sex and age-group, measured ex vivo.</babelon:source_value>
